# CAMPAIGN TRAP 10: this branch has twice shipped a bloated PR diff from tracked
# build artefacts. Every binary and every profiler trace produced in this
# directory must be covered here, and the diff stays text-only.
#
# The A/B binaries. `gemvab_*` alone was NOT enough -- the harness this pass
# added is `gemvsegab_v`, which that pattern does not match, and it was caught
# only by reading `git status --untracked-files=all` before finishing.
gemvab_*
gemvsegab_v
gemvsegab_*
*.o
*.so
*.a
# Profiler output.
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
*.ncu-rep
*.json
nsys/
ncu/
# Harness stderr spool: regenerated by every sweep, never read as a result.
*_err.txt
*.raw
